entries[44600] = { ["name"] = "Tome of Polymorph: Serpent", ["text"] = "Classes: Mage\nRequires Level 60\nUse: Teaches Polymorph: Serpent.\nTransforms the enemy into a harmless serpent, forcing it to slither around for up to 50 sec. While wandering, the serpent cannot attack or cast spells but will regenerate very quickly. Any damage will transform the target back into its normal form. Only one target can be polymorphed at a time. Only works on Beasts, Humanoids and Critters.\nSell Price:" }
